# ============================================================
# RISCV_BASEDON_PANGU   pin/package constraint TEMPLATE  (76 ports)
# Top module : top   (rtl/perip/top.sv)     Package: FBG484 (PGL50H)
#
# !! DO NOT ADD THIS FILE TO THE PROJECT WHILE TODO IS STILL THERE !!
# Every PAP_IO_LOC below is the placeholder TODO. PDS reads it as a literal
# package pin named "TODO" and refuses to place it, one error per port:
#     E: UserConstraintEditor-0008: ... Package pin TODO can not be placed.
#
# HOW TO USE
#   1. Replace every {TODO} with the real pin number from the board schematic,
#      e.g.  define_attribute {p:i_uart_rx} {PAP_IO_LOC} {D18}
#   2. Check PAP_IO_VCCIO / PAP_IO_STANDARD against the bank voltage of that pin
#      (LVCMOS33/3.3 below is only a placeholder; the clock pair uses LVDS25).
#   3. Only when no TODO is left:
#        - either add this file to the project (Add Constraint File),
#        - or paste the Io Table section into pins.fdc.
#   4. Ports that you leave unconstrained are simply auto-placed by PDS;
#      you can also delete the lines you do not want to constrain yet.
# ============================================================

